You can use jrmc (the UI) or 

jrcmd 19846 X
 where X = start_recording 
         = stop_recording
	 = check_recording (to get a list of existing recordings)
	 = dump_recording id=record_id  copy_to_file=outputfilename

======

To have always-on profiling enabled run app with -XX:FlightRecorderOptions=dumponexit=true,dumponexitpath=<path>
